    "## 13. Install into your local Ollama\n",
    "\n",
    "The download is about 2 GB. On the machine running Ollama:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Put the `.gguf` somewhere permanent, e.g.\n",
    "   `C:\\Users\\SI MARK\\.ollama\\capstrack-duplication-v3.gguf`\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Create a `Modelfile` beside it:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "FROM ./capstrack-duplication-v3.gguf\n",
    "SYSTEM You are Qwen, created by Alibaba Cloud. You are a helpful assistant.\n",
    "PARAMETER temperature 0\n",
    "PARAMETER min_p 0\n",
    "PARAMETER top_p 1\n",
    "PARAMETER top_k 1\n",
    "PARAMETER stop <|im_end|>\n",
    "PARAMETER stop <|endoftext|>\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "The sampling parameters are not optional. The first model baked in\n",
    "`temperature 1.5`, which is what made the same document score differently on\n",
    "repeated runs.\n",
    "\n",
    "3. Create it:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "ollama create capstrack-duplication-v3 -f Modelfile\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "4. **Test it against the old one before switching everything.** Point only the\n",
    "   judge at it first, leaving reading and expert-suggestion where they are:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "OLLAMA_JUDGE_MODEL=capstrack-duplication-v3\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Restart `php artisan serve`, run a real check, compare. If it judges well,\n",
    "move `OLLAMA_MODEL` across too and delete the line.\n",
    "\n",
    "5. If it is worse, delete the line. Nothing else has to change to go back."
